          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukingo ogwo yaagukorera enyomyo ina z'eminyinya, yaazishweka n'ezaabu; eby'okuhanikaho byazo byaba eby'ezaabu; yaaziheeshera ebiina by'efeeza bina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaakora omukingo gw'okukinga aha muryango gw'Eihema, yaagukora omu myenda ya bururu, eya bujwa, eya karari n'eya kitaani, ebaziirwemu amabara gacwereraine; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaakora n'enyomyo zaagwo itaano n'eby'okuhanikaho byazo. Yaashweka emitwe yaazo n'obufunga bwazo n'ezaabu; kwonka ebiina byazo ebitaano byaba eby'emiringa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.38",
